    ; LEGAL-NEXT: [[INSERT_SUBVECTOR1:%[0-9]+]]:_(<6 x i32>) = G_INSERT_SUBVECTOR [[INSERT_SUBVECTOR]], [[BITCAST1]](<2 x i32>), 2
